# Workers static-assets redirects (https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/).
# The documentation is served at this site's root: the home is /, a rule is /rules/<id>. Every /docs
# address answers with a permanent redirect to the same path without the prefix. A destination with no
# query string of its own keeps the request's, so /docs/playground?x=1 arrives at /playground?x=1.
# tests/tooling/cloudflareDeploy.test.ts checks both rules.
/docs / 301
/docs/* /:splat 301
